| `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.env.<var>` | string | `slurm` sets `SLURM_EXIT_IMMEDIATE` to `{not_allocated_status}` and `SLURM_EXIT_ERROR` to `{farm_error_status}` | a variable name mapped to a template with the same placeholders as `submit` | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `render` | Sets a variable for the submit command, so the farm reports a job it did not start, and its own failure, with the statuses below. | a credential: `launcher.credentials` | always |
